---
import SiteShell from "../components/SiteShell.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
---

<SiteShell title="Terms & Conditions" description="The terms governing your use of Simple Sketchpad.">
  <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Last updated: September 2026. These Terms &amp; Conditions ("Terms") govern your use of {SITE.name}
    ("we", "us", or "our") — the website and its online sketchpad service. By accessing or using the
    service, you agree to be bound by these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the service.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">1. Using the Service</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    {SITE.name} is provided as a free, client-side drawing tool. You may use it for personal and
    commercial purposes, subject to these Terms. There is no account, sign-up, or fee required.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">2. Your Content</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    You retain all rights to the drawings and text you create. Because everything is processed and stored
    locally in your browser, we do not receive, store, or claim ownership of your content. You are solely
    responsible for the content you create and for any use you make of exported files.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">3. Acceptable Use</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    You agree not to use the service to create or distribute content that is unlawful, harassing,
    defamatory, obscene, or otherwise inappropriate, or to attempt to disrupt, reverse engineer, or
    interfere with the service in any way.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">4. No Warranty</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    The service is provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, whether express
    or implied, including but not limited to implied warranties of merchantability, fitness for a
    particular purpose, and non-infringement. We do not warrant that the service will be uninterrupted,
    error-free, or secure.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, we shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental,
    special, consequential, or punitive damages, or for any loss of data, arising out of or related to
    your use of the service. In no event shall our total liability exceed the amount you paid to use the
    service (which is zero).
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">6. Data Stored Locally</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    The sketchpad automatically saves your drawing to your browser's local storage so it can be restored
    on your next visit. This data stays on your device and can be cleared at any time via your browser.
    Clearing browser data may permanently remove saved drawings. See our
    <a href="/privacy" class="font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-primary">Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">7. Third-Party Services</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    The service may link to third-party websites (such as our GitHub repository). We are not responsible
    for the content or practices of any third-party site.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">8. Changes to These Terms</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    We may update these Terms from time to time. The current version will always be posted on this page
    with the "last updated" date shown above. Continued use of the service after changes takes effect
    constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">9. Governing Law</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    These Terms are governed by applicable laws in your jurisdiction. If any provision is found to be
    unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in full effect.
  </p>

  <h2 class="mt-10 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">10. Contact</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-7 text-ink-secondary">
    Questions about these Terms? Reach us at
    <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="font-medium text-primary underline decoration-primary/30 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-primary">{SITE.email}</a>.
  </p>
</SiteShell>